{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113632","id":3075501790,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc63UG7e","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113632","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113632.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113632.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113632","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113632/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113632/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113632/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/209899834712c664d27e9b4b3200e401ccecdfc1","number":113632,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Add support for profiling system calls from GDScript with the tracy integration.","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"- Follow-up of #113279 \r\n- Implements the rest of https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112707\r\n\r\nAdds support for profiling system calls from GDScript:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"841\" height=\"213\" alt=\"SCR-20251205-oaes\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0f3f73f6-5296-4e10-8b30-e93a28e624cb\" />\r\n\r\nThe initial work has been done by @enetheru, although I ended up with a different implementation to theirs. The reason is that #112707 used the \"rename\" / \"dynamic name\" API, which leads to a lot of data leaks. As in the previous PR, that means that RAM quickly fills up when profiling.\r\nThis PR doesn't leak large amounts of data, which means it should be possible to profile (almost) indefinitely.\r\n\r\n### Approach\r\n\r\nThis uses the implementation from #113279 to intern source location data. I just needed to add a few parameters to make it compatible with both.\r\n\r\nFor now, this implementation seems to be fast enough (very little overhead), though we need to keep an eye on it. If tracing starts slowing people's games down, there's a number of things we could do in the future:\r\n\r\n- Add a compile time parameter for not tracing system calls\r\n- Somehow improve the interning mechanism's speed\r\n- Make the GDScript VM complicit in caching profile data, such that it can be retrieved during execution\r\n\r\nI'm also not 100% sure that the approach of using e.g. `methodname` (the pointer the the `StringName`) is extremely robust, but I think the worst that could happen is misleading file names / lines for a particular system call.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archive